The answer is **a net increase of 17%**.', '2026-11-14T06:17:56.365Z');
INSERT INTO questions (id, set_id, topic_label, topic_order, sort_order, q, a, created_at) VALUES ('mathx-q00086', 'math-aptitude-bank-2', 'Percentages, Profit & Loss, and Interest', 1, 19, 'A value undergoes a decrease of 15% followed by an increase of 20%. Find the net percentage change.', 'For two successive percentage changes `p1` and `p2`, the net change factor is `(1 + p1/100)(1 + p2/100)`.

