The answer is **A takes 16.67 days, B takes 25 days**.', '2026-11-14T06:17:56.365Z');
INSERT INTO questions (id, set_id, topic_label, topic_order, sort_order, q, a, created_at) VALUES ('mathx-q00258', 'math-aptitude-bank-2', 'Time, Speed, Distance & Work', 3, 59, 'A is 4 times as efficient as B. Working together, they complete a piece of work in 20 days. In how many days can A alone, and B alone, complete the work?', 'If B alone takes `b` days, A alone takes `b/4` days (since A is 4 times as efficient). Their combined one-day work is `4/b + 1/b = (4+1)/b`, which equals `1/20`.

